    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a medieval village, the inhabitants tell each other a legend about a vampire-like beast that kidnaps people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Elaine ventures too far into the dark forest and is attacked by a monster. When she wakes up, she finds herself in an abandoned castle. She wants to escape as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark places and learn all about the secrets of the abandoned castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the truth about the mysterious legend and the monster in this exciting hidden object adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tricky puzzles and play many relaxing mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the exciting story about a sinister legend in this hidden object game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in numerous fantastic hidden object scenes with lots of tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve many mini-games and tricky puzzles</p></li></ul>",
